# LivingCanvas — local mode (the open-source edition). Public values only: NEVER put a key here.
# Your own model / voice keys go in the gitignored .env.local at the repository root (or the in-app settings).
#
# Read by the server (pnpm dev / pnpm start), the web build (Vite) and the launchers. Change WORLDLINES_LOGIN
# to choose how this build runs:
#   on   the worlds that ship with this copy and your saves play signed out with your own key; signing in with a
#        Worldlines account adds the shared worlds other players publish, cloud saves, publishing, and the
#        account's models and voices. Your own keys still work and win where set
#   off  bring your own key only: no sign-in, no account services, nothing is reported anywhere
AIRP_DEPLOY=local
WORLDLINES_LOGIN=on

# The first-run experience: a new visitor who may play signed out confirms a language and
# plays 末班车 · 序章 before the lobby. 0 turns it off; ?first-run=1 forces it once (local testing).
VITE_AIRP_FIRST_RUN=1

# No guest trial here: with WORLDLINES_LOGIN=on the worlds on this computer play signed out with
# the player's own key, and only worlds shared through the Worldlines services ask for an account. The guest trial
# is the hosted site's (config/.env.remote); the server ignores AIRP_GUEST_TRIAL in
# local mode (apps/server sync/remote-client.ts guestTrialOn).

# The Worldlines account services (used only with WORLDLINES_LOGIN=on, and only once you sign in).
AIRP_ID_BASE=https://auth.worldlines.gg
AIRP_STORAGE_BASE=https://storage.worldlines.gg
AIRP_AI_ACCOUNT_BASE=https://ai.worldlines.gg/v1
AIRP_BILLING_BASE=https://billing.worldlines.gg
AIRP_CHRONICLE_BASE=https://chronicle.worldlines.gg
AIRP_DATA_BASE=https://data.worldlines.gg
